      {"id":"turn-down","en":"turn down","ru":"убавить (звук, огонь)","ex":"The oven is too hot. Turn it down to 150 degrees.","unit":142},
      {"id":"knock-down","en":"knock down","ru":"снести (здание); сбить (машиной)","ex":"Some old houses were knocked down to make way for the new shopping centre.","unit":142},
      {"id":"cut-down","en":"cut down","ru":"срубить","ex":"Why did you cut down the tree in your garden?","unit":142},
      {"id":"burn-down","en":"burn down","ru":"сгореть дотла","ex":"They put out the fire before the house burnt down.","unit":142},
      {"id":"slow-down","en":"slow down","ru":"сбавить скорость","ex":"You’re driving too fast. Slow down.","unit":142},
