      {"id":"cut-down-on","en":"cut down on","ru":"сократить, меньше (есть, пить, делать)","ex":"I’m trying to cut down on coffee.","unit":142},
      {"id":"close-down","en":"close down","ru":"закрыться (о магазине, фирме)","alt":["shut down"],"ex":"There used to be a shop here. It closed down a few years ago.","unit":142},
      {"id":"let-down","en":"let down","ru":"подвести","ex":"You can always rely on Paul. He’ll never let you down.","unit":142},
      {"id":"turn-down-2","en":"turn down","ru":"отклонить, отказать","ex":"Rachel was offered the job, but she decided to turn it down.","unit":142},
      {"id":"write-down","en":"write down","ru":"записать","ex":"I can’t remember Ben’s address. I wrote it down, but I can’t find it.","unit":142},
