      {"id":"bring-up","en":"bring up","ru":"воспитывать (ребёнка)","ex":"She was brought up by her grandparents.","unit":143},
      {"id":"tidy-up","en":"tidy up","ru":"прибраться","alt":["clean up","clear up"],"ex":"Look at this mess! Who’s going to tidy up?","unit":143},
      {"id":"wash-up","en":"wash up","ru":"мыть посуду","ex":"I hate washing up.","unit":143},
      {"id":"end-up","en":"end up","ru":"в итоге оказаться, закончиться (чем-то)","ex":"I couldn’t find a hotel and ended up sleeping at the station.","unit":143},
      {"id":"make-up","en":"make up","ru":"составлять (часть чего-то)","ex":"Children under 16 make up half the population of the city.","unit":143},
      {"id":"take-up-2","en":"take up","ru":"занимать (место, время)","ex":"Most of the space in the room was taken up by a large table.","unit":143},
