      {"id":"come-up-with","en":"come up with","ru":"придумать, предложить (идею)","ex":"She’s always coming up with new ideas.","unit":144},
      {"id":"make-up-2","en":"make up","ru":"выдумать, сочинить","ex":"What Kevin told you about himself wasn’t true. He made it all up.","unit":144},
      {"id":"cheer-up","en":"cheer up","ru":"взбодриться; развеселить","ex":"You look so sad! Cheer up!","unit":144},
      {"id":"save-up","en":"save up","ru":"копить (на что-то)","ex":"Dan is saving up for a trip to New Zealand.","unit":144},
      {"id":"clear-up","en":"clear up","ru":"проясниться (о погоде)","ex":"It was raining when I got up, but it cleared up later.","unit":144},
      {"id":"blow-up","en":"blow up","ru":"взорваться; взорвать","ex":"The engine caught fire and blew up.","unit":144},
      {"id":"tear-up","en":"tear up","ru":"разорвать (на куски)","ex":"I didn’t read the letter. I just tore it up.","unit":144},
      {"id":"beat-up","en":"beat up","ru":"избить","ex":"A friend of mine was attacked and beaten up.","unit":144},
      {"id":"split-up","en":"split up","ru":"расстаться","alt":["break up"],"ex":"I’m surprised to hear that Kate and Paul have split up.","unit":144},
      {"id":"do-up","en":"do up","ru":"застегнуть; отремонтировать","ex":"It’s quite cold. Do up your coat before you go out.","unit":144},
      {"id":"look-up","en":"look up","ru":"посмотреть (в словаре, справочнике)","ex":"If you don’t know the meaning of a word, you can look it up.","unit":144},
      {"id":"put-up-with","en":"put up with","ru":"терпеть, мириться с","ex":"We have to put up with a lot of noise from the traffic.","unit":144},
      {"id":"hold-up","en":"hold up","ru":"задерживать","ex":"Don’t wait for me. I don’t want to hold you up.","unit":144},
      {"id":"mix-up","en":"mix up","ru":"перепутать","ex":"The two brothers look very similar. People often mix them up.","unit":144},
      {"id":"go-away","en":"go away","ru":"уехать (из дома, в отпуск)","ex":"We’re going away on holiday today.","unit":145},
      {"id":"be-back","en":"be back","ru":"вернуться, снова быть здесь","ex":"We’ll be back in three weeks.","unit":145},
      {"id":"drive-away","en":"drive away","ru":"уехать (на машине)","ex":"Sarah got into her car and drove away.","unit":145},
      {"id":"fly-away","en":"fly away","ru":"улететь","ex":"I tried to take a picture of the bird, but it flew away.","unit":145},
      {"id":"give-back","en":"give back","ru":"вернуть, отдать обратно","ex":"I forgot to give Jane’s keys back to her.","unit":145},
      {"id":"put-back","en":"put back","ru":"положить обратно (на место)","ex":"Can you put the book back on the shelf?","unit":145},
      {"id":"take-away","en":"take away","ru":"забрать, унести","ex":"The police searched the house and took away a computer.","unit":145},
      {"id":"get-away","en":"get away","ru":"убежать, скрыться","ex":"We tried to catch the thief, but she got away.","unit":145},
      {"id":"get-away-with","en":"get away with","ru":"сойти с рук","ex":"I parked in a no-parking zone, but I got away with it.","unit":145},
      {"id":"keep-away-from","en":"keep away from","ru":"держаться подальше от","ex":"Keep away from the edge of the pool.","unit":145},
      {"id":"give-away","en":"give away","ru":"отдать, раздать (даром)","ex":"‘Did you sell your bike?’ ‘No, I gave it away.’","unit":145},
      {"id":"put-away","en":"put away","ru":"убрать (на место)","ex":"When the children finished playing with their toys, they put them away.","unit":145},
      {"id":"wave-back","en":"wave back","ru":"помахать в ответ","ex":"I waved to her, and she waved back.","unit":145},
      {"id":"call-back","en":"call back","ru":"перезвонить","alt":["phone back","ring back"],"ex":"I can’t talk now. I’ll call you back in ten minutes.","unit":145},
      {"id":"get-back-to","en":"get back to","ru":"ответить, связаться (позже)","ex":"I sent him an email, but he never got back to me.","unit":145},
      {"id":"look-back-on","en":"look back on","ru":"оглядываться назад, вспоминать","ex":"Looking back on it, I learnt a lot.","unit":145},
      {"id":"pay-back","en":"pay back","ru":"вернуть (долг)","ex":"Thanks for lending me the money. I’ll pay you back next week.","unit":145}
    ]},
    {"id":"prepositions","title":"Words + prepositions","about":"a reason for, interested in, depend on … — which preposition follows.","ask":"gap","units":[129,136], "entries": [
      {"id":"a-demand-for","en":"a demand [for]","ru":"спрос на","ex":"There was no demand for its product any more.","unit":129},
      {"id":"a-need-for","en":"a need [for]","ru":"необходимость, потребность в","ex":"There’s no need for it.","unit":129},
      {"id":"a-reason-for","en":"a reason [for]","ru":"причина (чего-то)","ex":"Nobody knew the reason for the delay.","unit":129},
      {"id":"a-cause-of","en":"a cause [of]","ru":"причина (события)","ex":"The cause of the explosion is unknown.","unit":129},
