      {"id":"a-fall-in","en":"a fall [in]","ru":"падение, снижение (чего-то)","ex":"There was a big fall in sales.","unit":129},
      {"id":"damage-to","en":"damage [to]","ru":"ущерб, повреждение (чему-то)","ex":"I had to pay for the damage to the other car.","unit":129},
